{"id":"660025","name":"西兰花金枪鱼沙拉","author":"seiseizhang","authorId":"2304656","desc":"","cover":"images/660025/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"西兰花","amount":"1/2颗"},{"name":"山芋","amount":"1/2个"},{"name":"金枪鱼罐头","amount":"1罐"}],"sub":[{"name":"红彩椒","amount":"1/4颗"},{"name":"黄彩椒","amount":"1/4颗"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"山芋洗净，隔水蒸透。","img":"images/660025/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"西兰花洗净、切小房，彩椒切小块，洗净。","img":"images/660025/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"小汤锅烧开水，焯熟西兰花和彩椒。","img":"images/660025/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"捞出后，用凉水冲洗，沥干。","img":"images/660025/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"蒸熟的山芋取出放凉，去皮，切小块。","img":"images/660025/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"蔬菜摆盘，浇上金枪鱼罐头。","img":"images/660025/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"浇适量油醋汁即可。","img":"images/660025/step_7.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：汤锅、蒸锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}